{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"daf99782-d147-40dc-9fb2-546849ab6480","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented all the analytics events specified in [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///private/tmp/h-RLyt05/docs/EVENTS.md) on the registration and offers screens using the existing [`Analytics`](file:///private/tmp/h-RLyt05/lib/analytics.dart) wrapper.\n\n### Summary of Actions Taken:\n1. **Queried Worklore**: Queried `worklore_worklore` using `suggest_for_project` and fetched story `2026-10-07-posthog-free-tier-gone-in-days-flutter-sent-an-event-per-key`. Followed its guidance to avoid event quota flooding by tracking text field typing once on first keystroke, slider change on `onChangeEnd`, and scroll on `ScrollEndNotification`.\n2. **Registration Screen ([`registration_screen.dart`](file:///private/tmp/h-RLyt05/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart))**:\n   - `registration_email_started`: Fires once on the first email input change (no PII sent).\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Fires once on the first phone input change (no PII sent).\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Fires when the slider drag ends (`onChangeEnd`) with `{'amount': v.round()}` (`int`).\n   - `terms_accepted`: Fires when the terms checkbox is checked (`true`).\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Fires when the Continue button is tapped with `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}`.\n3. **Offers Screen ([`offer_screen.dart`](file:///private/tmp/h-RLyt05/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart))**:\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Wrapped `ListView.builder` in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` firing with `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}` (`double`).\n4. **Documentation \u0026 Validation**:\n   - Validated the code using `dart analyze lib/` (0 issues).\n   - Documented the changes in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///private/tmp/h-RLyt05/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":106.489998,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":205009,"output_tokens":4491,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":211705,"total_tokens":209500}}}
